sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant A as Agent
  participant O as OpenPencil

  U->>A: Select state and say intent
  A->>O: Create edit version
  O-->>A: Isolated preview
  A-->>U: Show source beside edit
  alt Revise
    U->>A: Refine the intent
    A->>O: Update the same branch
  else Keep
    U->>A: Approve
    A->>O: Mark ready for promotion
  end

